  "typeCharacter": "Archivo in extra-bold, sentence case, set very large and tight like a confident ledger heading (h1 about 7vw, section heads about 4vw), with Public Sans at regular weight for running text and tabular figures in the service rows and the phone numeral.",
  "composition": "Thin header on the pale green-grey ground: wordmark Računovodstvo Seliškar set in Archivo bold at top left (cols 1-4), small text links at right, a full-width hairline below. Hero (cols 1-7): huge left-aligned Archivo h1 over four lines, lead in Public Sans spanning cols 1-6, one rectangular deep green button with square corners; cols 8-12: an ink drawing of field strips seen from above, bleeding to the right page edge. A vertical double rule in deep green sits at the left of col 2 in the hero and repeats in each section, like a ledger margin. Section two, full-width deep green band: heading Za koga delamo at left (cols 1-4); cols 6-12 hold s.p., d.o.o., društva stacked as giant Archivo words, each underlined by a thin rapeseed-yellow rule, with the highlights as short lines of text beneath in cols 6-11 (2004, Pomurje and all of Slovenia, Hungarian spoken). Section three, Storitve, on the pale ground styled as a ledger page: heading cols 1-4 with the e-mail or in-person sentence below; cols 5-12 a ruled list of the six services, each a full row between hairlines with a small tabular row marker in deep green at the margin. Section four, story, on the light surface tint: cols 1-5 a second smaller field-strip drawing, cols 7-12 heading and paragraph about the director and two accountants. Section five, contact on white-green ground: phone as a large Archivo numeral across cols 1-7 with the line about announcing your visit above it, the single call button below; cols 8-12 address, e-mail and a simple schematic map of Slovenska ulica in deep green lines on the surface tint. Footer: thin deep green band with company name and address in small Public Sans.",
  "imagery": "No photographs anywhere. Two pieces of drawn art, each on the plain pale ground #f2f6f1 and apart from all text: a large ink line drawing of the Pomurje plain from above, long parallel field strips of varying widths with fine furrow hatching in deep green #1e4a33, a few strips filled flat rapeseed yellow #e2b227, no buildings, roads, signs or people; and a smaller square variant of the same strips in the story section. Plus a schematic map of thin lines.",
  "signature": "The services laid out as a ruled ledger page with a deep green double margin rule, echoing the drawn field strips of the flat Pomurje plain beside the headline.",
  "copy": {
    "headline": "Vaše knjige urejene v ravne vrstice, kot pomurske njive",
    "lead": "Od leta 2004 v Murski Soboti vodimo knjige, plače in DDV za samostojne podjetnike, manjša podjetja in društva. Dokumente pošljete po e-pošti ali jih prinesete osebno. Govorimo tudi madžarsko."
  },
  "imagePrompt": "One flat full-page screenshot of a desktop website homepage, 1536x1024 px, no browser window, no device frame, no perspective, no photographs and no people. Page ground very light green-grey #f2f6f1, text ink #16201a, muted text #4c5a51, hairlines #b9c8bc, one strong deep field green #1e4a33 and a small rapeseed yellow accent #e2b227. Typography: Archivo extra-bold, sentence case, very large and tightly set for headings; Public Sans regular for body text with tabular figures. Strict 12-column grid, left-aligned, generous margins. Header: thin bar on the pale ground, wordmark in Archivo bold at top left, a few small Public Sans links at right, a full-width hairline beneath. Hero: in columns 1-7 a huge four-line Archivo extra-bold headline in #16201a, below it a lead paragraph in Public Sans spanning columns 1-6, then one rectangular square-cornered button in #1e4a33 with #eef4ee label; a vertical double rule in #1e4a33 runs down the left edge of column 2 like the margin of a ledger. In columns 8-12, bleeding off the right page edge, a large ink line drawing of a flat agricultural plain seen from directly above: long parallel field strips of varying widths, slightly angled, drawn with fine furrow hatching in #1e4a33 on the plain #f2f6f1 ground, three or four strips filled flat #e2b227; no text, buildings, roads, signs, people or logos in the drawing, and kept clear of all type. Below the fold begins a full-width deep green #1e4a33 band: a heading in #eef4ee at left in columns 1-4; in columns 6-12 three giant stacked Archivo words in #eef4ee, each underlined by a thin #e2b227 rule, with short lines of Public Sans text beneath. Next section on the pale ground as a ruled ledger page: heading in columns 1-4 with a short sentence below; columns 5-12 a list of six service rows separated by full-width hairlines #b9c8bc, each with a small deep green row marker at the margin, again with the green double margin rule. Hint of a following section on light surface #e4ece4 at the bottom edge. Flat colour only, no gradients, no shadows, no rounded pill shapes, no icons, no emoji, nothing centred."
}

